تشغيل، ظهرت لي المشكلة اللي ظاهرة لك في الـ terminal ده. طلعت بره ورجعت تاني على سجل العمليات لقيته بيقول لي قيد التشغيل، طب أنت فشلت ولا أنت فشلت؟ وحتى الـ terminal فاضي، اللي هو سجل النظام، فمش شغال والـ icon هنا شغال اللي هو قيد التشغيل. طب أنت شغال ولا مش شغال، بايظ مش بايظ، هو أكيد في مشكلة بس أنا عارف إن دي bug يعني، فحل لي مشاكلك بجد. \n\n============================================================\r\n[*] Processing Shortages files (1 file(s))\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\n  -> File: test_shortages_200.xlsx (Type: .xlsx)\r\n  -> Reading Excel file: test_shortages_200.xlsx\r\n  -> Active sheet: ورقة2\r\n  -> Header row: 6 -> ['أسم العميل', 'أسم الصنف', 'الت\n<truncated 2859 bytes>\n9. أول حاجة ظهر 145 مطابقة، 45 لم يتم العثور، و10 محتاجين مراجعة. الملخص ده هو المفروض يكون مربوط بالشيتات التانية بحيث لما أعمل مراجعة أو أعمل تعديل يتظبط. بس أنا هطلع بره الإكسيل شوية، هروح للبرنامج، البرنامج تمام لما رحت السجل وعرضت النتائج وبعدين نزلت عملت إعادة المطابقة. المفروض يحصل بقى الـ pop-up اللي هو الـ loading وكأنه بقى بيشغل من أول وجديد وما أقدرش إني أعمل عملية جديدة، لكن ده مش متاح. هو عمل المطابقة في الـ background، لما تحت سجل النظام كان شغال وهبعت لك برضه السجل بتاع النظام. هو كان شغال تمام وما فيش مشكلة، بس المفروض إن أنا ممنوع إني أعمل مطابقة جديدة والمطابق\n<truncated 11030 bytes>\n10. بص، أنا عملت الهوفر تمام، بس أنا قلت لك خليها في نص الشمال. في السجل لو أنا بعمل ريران، تبقى موجودة في سجل العمليات في الجزء الشمال. ولما أجي أعمل عملية مطابقة جديدة، لو هعمل ملفات جديدة، تبقى تتحط في الكيو. بعد ما اللي إحنا شغالين في سجل العمليات تخلص، التانية تفتح. وفي كمان حاجة نسيت أقولها لك. أنا لما قفلت البرنامج وفتحته تاني، لقيت المطابقة اللي إحنا عملناها مش آخر تحديث. لقيت المطابقة اللي إحنا عملناها آخر مرة لما قفلت وفتحت لقيتها مختلفة شوية. التقرير ده بيتقري من الإكسيل. خلاص، هو اتثبت. تعال كده جرب تاني، أنا عملت إعادة تشغيل وهجرب تاني كده. اه، تمام كده\n<truncated 1078 bytes>\n\n<summary>\n# Continuation Summary — Pharmacy Matcher: UI Position, Process Queue, Discrepancy Fix & Environment Cleanup\n\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **User's Requests**:\n  1. **UI Position for Progress Modal**: The progress modal was centered over the entire screen (100vw), covering the right sidebar. In RTL, the sidebar is on the right and the active workspace is on the left. The user wants the progress modal located strictly within the left section (`نص الشمال` / `.main-content`), leaving the sidebar accessible and not awkwardly covering the entire window.\n  2. **Process Queuing (كيو)**: When a matching process is running and the user submits new shortage/warehouse files, do NOT block or error out; instead, queue the new job (`status: 'queued'`). As soon as the active process completes, the queued process must automatically start.\n  3. **Review Count Discrepancy (9 vs 16) Bug Fix**: During re-run, the app displayed 9 items needing review, but after opening Excel or clicking \"تنفيذ التعديلات\", the count jumped to 16. The user asked to identify and fix this caching/counting inconsistency.\n  4. **Clean up Unstructured & Process History**: Delete all Unstructured cached/result JSON files, wipe the process history in `data/history.db` and delete `data/processes/*` so the user can start a clean final test with all files and the full 1000 rows.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress & Completed Work\n\n### Completed:\n- **Discrepancy Root Cause Found & Fixed (`src/fast_match/coordinator.py`)**:\n  - *Cause*: In `FastCoordinator.process()`, `review_count` was computed as `len(review_only_names - found_names)` which subtracted items found in another warehouse (yielding 9). However, `excel_writer.py` wrote all warehouse `needs_review` candidates to the `يحتاج مراجعة` sheet (totaling 16 rows), and `apply_reviews` in `backend.py` counted the actual sheet rows (`max_row - 1 = 16`).\n  - *Fix*: Updated `coordinator.py` lines 105-120 so `total_wh_matched`, `total_review_items`, and `total_not_found` match the exact row counts written to the Excel sheets.\n- **Progress Modal UI Position Moved to Left (`desktop_app/templates/index.html`)**:\n  - Changed `#progress-modal` CSS from `position: fixed; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;` to `position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%;` with `z-index: 9999;`.\n  - Moved `#progress-modal` inside `<main class=\"main-content\">` (which has `position: relative; flex: 1;` on the left side of the RTL window). It now centers inside the left work area without obscuring the sidebar.\n- **Queue Logic Started (`desktop_app/backend.py`)**:\n  - Added `self._process_queue = []` to `API.__init__`.\n  - Updated `start_process` so if `self._worker_thread.is_alive()`, it marks the process as `queued`, appends `(process_id, shortage_paths, warehouse_paths)` to `self._process_queue`, and returns `{\"success\": True, \"process_id\": process_id, \"queued\": True}`.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings & Architecture\n- **Queue Execution Flow**:\n  - When the active process finishes in `_process_worker`, a `finally:` block must check `if self._process_queue:` and immediately pop and trigger the next worker thread, updating its status from `'queued'` to `'processing'` and notifying the UI.\n- **Unstructured Result Files to Remove**:\n  - In root: `transform-result-5adb330b-3b30-4894-9d61-d31e1197080a.json` and `transform-result-f5254d99-e492-48f1-8a36-1688af690395.json`.\n  - In `data/processes/`: previous folders `PROC-002`, `PROC-003`, and temporary JSON caches.\n  - In `data/history.db`: clear processes table (`DELETE FROM processes;`).\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- **Files Modified in Current Session**:\n  - `src/output/excel_writer.py` (formulas in summary sheet, Arabic confidence formatting).\n  - `src/fast_match/coordinator.py` (aligned `summary` counts with Excel rows, updated prompt for generic substitutions & identical quantities).\n  - `desktop_app/backend.py` (added `_process_queue`, queue handling in `start_process`, dynamic summary update in `apply_reviews`).\n  - `desktop_app/templates/index.html` (modal moved inside `.main-content` for left positioning).\n  - `scripts/package_production.py` (production packaging script).\n- **Environment**:\n  - Python: `d:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`.\n  - Workspace: `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy`.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps (Execute in Priority Order)\n\n1. **Complete Queue Auto-execution in `desktop_app/backend.py`**:\n   - In `_process_worker` around lines 390-400, add a `finally:` block:\n     ```python\n     finally:\n         with self._worker_lock:\n             if self._process_queue:\n                 next_id, next_shortages, next_warehouses = self._process_queue.pop(0)\n                 self.add_log(f\"[QUEUE] Triggering next process: [{next_id}]\")\n                 self._db.update_process(next_id, status='processing')\n                 self._worker_thread = threading.Thread(\n                     target=self._process_worker,\n                     args=(next_id, next_shortages, next_warehouses, False),\n                     daemon=True\n                 )\n                 self._worker_thread.start()\n             else:\n                 self._worker_thread = None\n     ```\n   - In `delete_process(process_id)`: remove `process_id` from `self._process_queue` if present.\n\n2. **Update Frontend UI for Queue (`desktop_app/templates/index.html`)**:\n   - In `submitProcess()`:\n     - Check if `res.queued`: show toast `\"تمت إضافة العملية إلى قائمة الانتظار بنجاح وستبدأ تلقائياً فور انتهاء العملية الحالية.\"`, reset new process inputs, and do not show `#progress-modal`.\n   - In `loadHistory()`:\n     - Add handling for `item.status === 'queued'`: badge class `badge-queued` with label `\"في الانتظار\"`.\n     - Add CSS `.badge-queued { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; border: 1px solid #fde68a; }`.\n\n3. **Perform Requested Cleanup**:\n   - Delete `transform-result-*.json` files from root.\n   - Wipe records in `data/history.db`: `DELETE FROM processes;`.\n   - Delete folders inside `data/processes/` (`PROC-002`, `PROC-003`).\n   - Clean `dist_production/` by re-running `python scripts/package_production.py`.\n\n4. **Verify & Update User**:\n   - Verify `start_process` queuing and history display.\n   - Present final status in Arabic, notifying the user that the UI modal is now anchored on the left workspace, the queue is active, the review counting bug is resolved, and the environment is clean for their full 1000-row test.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Keep modal contained in `.main-content` (left side in RTL layout) so sidebar remains visible and interactive.\n- Ensure `summary` in `coordinator.py` and `excel_writer.py` remain 100% aligned with exact row counts.\n- Wipe database and temporary unstructured files as explicitly requested before the user starts the full 1000-row run.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 51 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/desktop-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:17:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/pharmacy-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T10:46:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006220414]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006220414.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006245677]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006245677.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790008142552]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790008142552.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T16:29:03Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790030764891]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/9